  "id": "BIT-keycloak-2026-18571",
  "summary": "Keycloak-services: keycloak-services: fgap v2 group assignment bypass during user creation",
  "details": "A flaw was found in the user creation component of Keycloak when Fine-Grained Admin Permissions V2 (FGAP V2) is enabled. This issue allows a sub-administrator with permission to create users to add those users to any group, even groups the sub-administrator is not authorized to manage. This could lead to unauthorized access to sensitive information or elevated privileges for the newly created users.",
